        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beee91869f9cd37cbb018710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「#骏大祭 #酬神舞\r\n#声援 #多多指教」……\r\n好了！呵呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb500bb14f76243f7717bd402a95db5cb64a2097bc6a827a3123d1e129f9922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57268441373462cfea75384c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，谢谢大家转发♪\r\n……等着吧，全新的机伶\r\n会让大家有满～满的感动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f38f37d73fe02c51466424c0fc173c142052cbaeb55fec95ee76bb09abc5abeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d214b55fd96de5aa833c5d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么样的谜团，\r\n都能放心交给名侦探机伶♪",
