      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c39374e1312101360a0bf181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了，按赞数超过十万了♪\r\n大家要帮忙分享宇宙第一可爱的\r\n机伶穿决胜服的样子喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "143a74e5f832e45818f36fa1ddd3c4f1f5dfd9c600231863b6bcab8fd6961c33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e74f7f6d65f53be45d6616b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家～！我最喜欢你们咯♪\r\n来，你也迷上机伶吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a984a1f28bdc332ada0228c1d9cad957e53621abe2ee952b2ad6c43de72cfac6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
